      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "header",
      "description": "Pale navigation surface with slate links and purple active language.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Hoofdnavigatie\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#product\">Product</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#rollen\">Voor jouw rol</a><span class=\"ds-languages\"><a class=\"ds-language ds-active\" href=\"#nl\" aria-current=\"page\">NL</a><a class=\"ds-language\" href=\"#en\">EN</a></span></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;padding:16px;background:var(--rondo-surface-header,#F8FDF6);font-family:Figtree,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-nav-link{padding:8px 12px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:#334155;text-decoration:none}.ds-languages{display:flex;border-left:1px solid #CBD5E1;padding-left:4px;min-height:42px}.ds-language{padding:12px;font-size:15px;color:#334155;text-decoration:none}.ds-language.ds-active{color:var(--rondo-indigo,#993399);font-weight:600}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--rondo-indigo,#993399)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--rondo-indigo,#993399);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Product story panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "White bordered panel on a lilac section; purple story title and teal solution label.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-story\"><h3>Overzicht voor je club</h3><p>Productinformatie in een heldere, rustige leesvolgorde.</p><h4>Zo helpt Rondo</h4></section>",
      "css": ".ds-story{background:white;border:1px solid var(--rondo-border-soft,#CBD5E1);border-radius:20px;padding:31px 39px;font:18px/1.4 Figtree,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--rondo-text-body,#334155)}.ds-story h3{font-size:36px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;color:var(--rondo-indigo,#993399);margin:0 0 9px}.ds-story h4{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:var(--rondo-teal-dark,#008480);margin:28px 0 6px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "FAQ disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
